Cashflow Evidence - your way to track transactions

Our application provides following functionalities:

Transactions
Options to add, edit and delete records about your spending.

Categories
Define custom categories, which can be assigned to transactions.

Repeating transactions
Define templates for future expanses, with the possibility of setting a custom repetitions.

Imports and exports
Import and export your transactions in csv, json and pdf (only export).


